# Learning Product Model

Keep learning content and lab runtime definitions decoupled.
A room/lesson may reference a versioned lab but should not embed runtime implementation details.

Product concepts may include:
- learning paths,
- modules/rooms,
- lessons,
- tasks/questions/hints,
- labs,
- XP/levels/badges,
- certificates,
- organizations/instructors.

Replacing lab version v3 with v4 should not require rewriting unrelated lesson content.
